  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.12 - 2026-01-12\nAdded\n- Kraken Exchange: Full WebSocket API v2 support (wss://ws.kraken.com/v2)\n- Bitfinex Exchange: Full WebSocket API v2 support (channel ID-based routing)\n- Bitstamp Exchange: Full WebSocket API v2 support (wss://ws.bitstamp.net)\n- MEXC Exchange: Partial support (connection ready, requires protobuf for data)\n- Observability System: IChannelObserver, ChannelStatistics, ConnectionHealth\n- Dependency Injection: AddCcxtCollector() extension methods\n- Test Coverage: Increased from 154 to 439 tests (285% increase)\n\nChanged\n- Verified all 16 active exchanges using current API versions\n- Bitget V2 API migration completed\n\nFixed\n- Resolved all build warnings (0 warnings, 0 errors)\n- Removed deprecated Bittrex test file (exchange closed Dec 2023)",
